# PrDeliveryMerge — a concrete async SPAWN adapter (i787), re-expressing
# pr_delivery.hecksagon's 3rd binding — a bare `run "gh pr merge ..."`
# leaf, confirmed a hard no-op in the vendored gem (`DrivenCapture#run` is
# an explicit stub) — onto the proven spawned_by mechanism.
#
# MUTATING: squash-merges a real PR and deletes its branch. See
# pr_delivery_merge.hecksagon for the full rationale and the success-path-
# only field-delivery asymmetry that shaped CompleteMerge/FailMerge.
#
# Resolves IFF this adapter's declared port (spawn) carries the
# `spawned_by` verb. bin/adapter-host runs the handler via `/bin/sh -c`.
Hecks.adapter "PrDeliveryMerge" do
  port "spawn"
end
